{"h":3395,"lines":[{"t":"1718867188","x":0.7716049391467531,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.046511627815394085,"w":0.069958845774332645,"c":0.30000001192092896},{"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.053535155339712981,"w":0.113292236328125,"x":0.11516458131326605,"h":0.015022712545765593},{"w":0.68312759399414058,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"This area is famous for its ancient lighthouse, which you'll see from the boat as we turn past","c":1,"x":0.11728393952587425,"y":0.097383720823983833},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.65226333618164056,"x":0.11728397645650451,"t":"the first little island. It was built in 1838 to protect sailors as a number of shipwrecks had","y":0.11042402823149111,"c":1},{"h":0.0140298364861694,"c":1,"y":0.12414116009296372,"t":"led to significant loss of life. The construction itself was complicated as some of the original","w":0.67908259073893229,"x":0.11518629758709172},{"w":0.68724278767903646,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.1172839559336767,"t":"drawings kept by the local council show. It sits right on top of the cliffs in a very isolated spot.","y":0.1395348835959439,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"x":0.11728395666892368,"t":"In the nineteenth century there were many jobs there, such as polishing the brass lamps,","w":0.66049382527669276,"y":0.15400471169045937},{"t":"chopping firewood and cleaning windows, that kept lighthouse keepers busy. These workers","x":0.11728393950916219,"y":0.16860465104286715,"w":0.68312759399414069,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1},{"t":"were mainly prison convicts until the middle of that century when ordinary families willing to","y":0.18313953476382283,"w":0.67695475260416671,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.11522632730316464},{"x":0.11715366641497221,"y":0.19744363606286641,"t":"live in such circumstances took over.","h":0.013339218458663149,"c":1,"w":0.27392583211263022},{"t":"Some of you have asked me what creatures we can expect to see. I know everyone loves","c":1,"y":0.21937573604072846,"x":0.119341572782432,"h":0.011778563015312216,"w":0.66255142211914064},{"c":1,"w":0.66666666666666674,"t":"the penguins, but they're very shy and, unfortunately, tend to hide from passing boats, but","x":0.11728395051408474,"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.23401162780068452},{"t":"you might see birds in the distance, such as sea eagles, flying around the cliff edges where","x":0.11722640232751909,"y":0.24678583382869279,"c":1,"w":0.6750096638997396,"h":0.014706132549559991},{"t":"they nest. When we get to the rocky area inhabited by fur seals, we'll stop and watch them","y":0.26148409917052606,"h":0.013250883392226021,"x":0.11728394133628389,"c":1,"w":0.67078191121419262},{"t":"swimming around the coast. They're inquisitive creatures so don't be surprised if one pops up","h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1,"x":0.11728395489644072,"w":0.69341562906901044,"y":0.27761627897653285},{"x":0.11723455108505788,"h":0.014209972534359405,"c":1,"w":0.67088562011718755,"t":"right in front of you. Their predators, orca whales, hunt along the coastline too, but spotting","y":0.29040041532505345},{"y":0.30523255803209137,"x":0.11728393853352809,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.68930043538411456,"t":"one of these is rare. Dolphins, on the other hand, can sometimes approach on their own or in"},{"h":0.014424348748053206,"w":0.30678115844726561,"t":"groups as they ride the waves beside us.","x":0.11719880891513043,"y":0.31846451396824893,"c":1},{"x":0.11522634833451889,"w":0.65020573933919268,"c":1,"t":"Lastly, I want to mention the caves. Tasmania is famous for its caves and the ones we'll","y":0.34156976730893063,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"x":0.11728395871551452,"c":1,"t":"pass by are so amazing that people are lost for words when they see them. They can only","h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.35600706737042143,"w":0.66872426350911451},{"t":"be approached by sea, but if you feel that you want to see more than we're able to show","w":0.65432098388671878,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.11728395241322347,"c":1,"y":0.37063953477710676},{"t":"you, then you can take a kayak into the area on another day and one of our staff will give","w":0.65843622843424476,"x":0.11728394397096764,"y":0.38368669049190895,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226021},{"t":"you more information on that. What we'll do is to go through a narrow channel, past some","w":0.66255142211914064,"x":0.11728396006525826,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226021,"y":0.39811542972564995},{"t":"incredible rock formations and from there we'll be able to see the openings to the caves, and","y":0.41424418595354395,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.68312759399414058,"c":1,"x":0.11934155269459855},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.42726737328223774,"x":0.11522634160990136,"t":"at that point we'll talk to you about what lies beyond.","w":0.39094650268554682,"c":1},{"y":0.11011655661388098,"t":"Q15\/16","x":0.8332010028741702,"h":0.012325026261651995,"c":1,"w":0.059935442606608103},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Q15\/16","x":0.83333333472546955,"w":0.059670778910319022,"y":0.18313953475846456,"c":1},{"y":0.26158898986174006,"t":"Q17\/18","x":0.83331818083696396,"w":0.05970108668009444,"c":1,"h":0.011705741163417827},{"t":"Q17\/18","y":0.30523255801350957,"w":0.059670778910319022,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.83333333472179527},{"x":0.83323142645832948,"w":0.057816982269287109,"c":1,"t":"Q19\/20","h":0.012142300465362577,"y":0.35584745439679877},{"t":"Q19\/20","w":0.059898611704508498,"y":0.41249187678666077,"h":0.012225548707132994,"c":1,"x":0.8332194183251439},{"t":"PART 3","y":0.48089891347453728,"w":0.096830075581868486,"x":0.1172228221883537,"h":0.014946359066014048,"c":1},{"x":0.11522633797915108,"y":0.50872092998271712,"w":0.047325102488199877,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"DIANA:"},{"y":0.52325581370364738,"w":0.03086419741312664,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"TIM:","c":1,"x":0.11522633763602926},{"y":0.56528909381463432,"w":0.047454703648885099,"x":0.1151615373332372,"h":0.01331716094898816,"t":"DIANA:","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.5959302324486242,"t":"TIM:","w":0.028806584676106778,"x":0.11728395035741987,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"x":0.11517362670326087,"w":0.047430524826049814,"c":1,"h":0.011843782431666505,"y":0.62343857378520284,"t":"DIANA:"},{"t":"TIM:","x":0.11728395035741987,"c":1,"y":0.63953488361141486,"w":0.028806584676106778,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.11522633797915108,"h":0.013081394460653373,"t":"DIANA:","y":0.66569767469917918,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.68168604625062357,"x":0.11728395066606183,"w":0.028806584676106764,"t":"TIM:","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"DIANA:","y":0.72372927199269121,"x":0.1151736268115493,"w":0.047430524826049814,"h":0.011843781308375156},{"w":0.028806584676106764,"x":0.11728395035741986,"y":0.73982558128064257,"t":"TIM:","h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"x":0.11728395071617095,"y":0.76744186024650529,"t":"DIANA:","w":0.043209877014160153},{"y":0.79651162768620531,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"TIM:","x":0.11522633761030912,"c":1,"w":0.030864197413126626},{"w":0.047495307922363283,"h":0.013391791299880662,"t":"DIANA:","x":0.11514123526420808,"c":1,"y":0.80943782511897888},{"c":1,"x":0.11522633740454781,"h":0.010174418787512463,"t":"TIM:","w":0.03086419741312664,"y":0.82558139522349183},{"y":0.50654993431362483,"h":0.013987325526800265,"w":0.55562754313151053,"c":1,"x":0.20778137534413882,"t":"So, Tim, we have to do a short summary of our work experience on a farm."},{"y":0.52179034164141602,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.56378601074218748,"c":1,"x":0.20781892867847745,"t":"Right. My farm was great, but arranging the work experience was hard. One"},{"y":0.53621908104627325,"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.57201644897460946,"x":0.20781893594148906,"t":"problem was it was miles away and I don't drive. And also, I'd really wanted a"},{"y":0.55087209291563777,"w":0.46090535481770833,"x":0.20987654061185471,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"placement for a month, but I could only get one for two weeks."},{"w":0.5617284138997396,"x":0.20576130736994477,"y":0.5653710245623137,"t":"I was lucky, the farmer let me stay on the farm so I didn't have to travel. But","h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"t":"finding the right sort of farm to apply to wasn't easy.","x":0.20568090676969358,"w":0.3849331919352213,"c":1,"h":0.014485984865150403,"y":0.57859401905523766},{"y":0.59284586424976815,"t":"No, they don't seem to have websites, do they. I found mine through a friend of","w":0.58655604044596354,"h":0.016085584256337326,"c":1,"x":0.20776223144294287},{"t":"my mother's, but it wasn't easy.","x":0.20987654546323833,"y":0.60895170806607257,"w":0.23456789652506513,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"y":0.63662790684172443,"x":0.20576131890558685,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"My farm was mostly livestock, especially sheep. I really enjoyed helping out with","w":0.59670781453450528},{"t":"them. I was up most of one night helping a sheep deliver a lamb...","x":0.20576130865304834,"w":0.49794240315755212,"h":0.013250883392226243,"y":0.65106007064089444,"c":1},{"w":0.10493827184041341,"x":0.20987654298925831,"y":0.66569767430224724,"t":"On your own?","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"w":0.5864197285970052,"y":0.68021201414480204,"x":0.20987655534173408,"h":0.013101939458588729,"t":"No, the farmer was there, and he told me what to do. It wasn't a straightforward","c":1},{"t":"birth, but I managed. It was a great feeling to see the lamb stagger to its feet and","w":0.59876541137695305,"x":0.20781894032668599,"y":0.69464075358981647,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.4588477579752604,"t":"start feeding almost straightaway, and to know that it was OK.","x":0.20781891926434676,"y":0.70930232546082739},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Then another time a lamb had broken its leg, and they got the vet in to set it, and","w":0.59876541137695316,"y":0.73837209291675188,"c":1,"x":0.20781894029917775},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.20781892459762011,"t":"he talked me through what he was doing. That was really useful.","y":0.75290697663709838,"w":0.47942387898763028,"c":1},{"t":"Yes, my farm had sheep too. The farm was in a valley and they had a lowland","x":0.20781892868278382,"w":0.56378601074218748,"y":0.76590106022499627,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.20781894029049577,"t":"breed called Suffolks, although the farmer said they'd had other breeds in the past.","w":0.59876541137695316,"y":0.78052325569363989,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"So were they bred for their meat?","x":0.20781893412981658,"y":0.7950530037325293,"w":0.25102879842122394,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"y":0.80948174315678612,"w":0.28806584676106772,"c":1,"x":0.20781892838078306,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"Mostly, yes. They're quite big and solid"},{"y":0.82412790685644222,"w":0.57818929036458333,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"My farm was up in the hills and they had a different breed of sheep, they were","x":0.20781893495439258,"c":1},{"y":0.52180232542296234,"w":0.034979422887166267,"t":"Q21","h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.83333333372745588},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"Q22","w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.65116279055684501,"c":1,"x":0.83333333393687814},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.83333333394373676,"y":0.79505813937372516,"t":"Q23"},{"t":"98","x":0.1152263369625553,"c":1,"w":0.026748971939086902,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.86773255795657411},{"w":0.30619837443033859,"x":0.66984496081179823,"y":0.95314993691982619,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.035152653221247165,"c":1}],"w":2400}